{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music by SHINE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592620/extras/500a99ff223ddae1bf6b81ae05747764.avif?t=1743116426\" width=577 height=149 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soon-to-be music phenomenon SHINE provides the music with the \u00abSounds From The Afterlife - Concept Album For Messorem\u00bb. The norwegian 8-piece delivers an astounding 65+ minutes of live orchestrated music that paints the world of the game with a magical assortment of sounds, genres-variety and instrumentation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592620/extras/4685618cd89d9ca0c744c48be889b668.avif?t=1743116426\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592620/extras_big/4685618cd89d9ca0c744c48be889b668.avif?t=1743116426 width=800 height=231 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SHINE brings the action and drama to new levels with the two vocal-tracks \u00abThe Final Hour\u00bb and \u00abShimmer\u00bb. From blistering speed-metal to folky J-pop undertones, the band delivers audible spectacle like no first-time Indie game has ever seen (or in this case heard) before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All purchases goes directly to the band!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3592620?t=1743116426","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3592620?t=1743116426","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592620/19609e69beba292163feff6fee5a47f4418717e7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743116426","capsule_imagev